1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,791
Part One: Introduction

2
00:00:03,791 --> 00:00:07,625
Understanding
and managing pain during radiotherapy.

3
00:00:08,916 --> 00:00:12,500
As you begin to undergo radiation
treatment to your head and neck.

4
00:00:12,708 --> 00:00:16,250
One symptom
that is likely to present itself is pain.

5
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:18,875
In this video we will explain:

6
00:00:18,875 --> 00:00:22,708
Where in your body
you may experience pain, and to assure you

7
00:00:22,708 --> 00:00:27,333
that we are here to help you through it
with various pain management techniques

8
00:00:28,291 --> 00:00:31,291
Mucositis: Rinses and Gargles.

9
00:00:31,583 --> 00:00:34,791
One common cause of pain during radiotherapy 

10
00:00:34,791 --> 00:00:37,375
is a condition called mucositis.

11
00:00:37,375 --> 00:00:41,791
This is when the lining of your mouth
and throat gets sore and inflamed.

12
00:00:42,083 --> 00:00:46,625
To help with this, we often recommend
special rinses and gargles.

13
00:00:46,625 --> 00:00:50,916
You might use something called Muguard
or even a baking soda rinse

14
00:00:50,916 --> 00:00:52,291
to soothe your mouth.

15
00:00:52,291 --> 00:00:56,625
We have a separate video
that explains mucositis in more detail

16
00:00:57,291 --> 00:00:59,541
oral cavity or mouth pain:

17
00:00:59,541 --> 00:01:01,583
special rinses and medicines.

18
00:01:02,166 --> 00:01:06,291
If the pain is in your mouth,
we might suggest special rinses

19
00:01:06,291 --> 00:01:09,666
or even medicines
like Doxepin or Morphine.

20
00:01:10,083 --> 00:01:13,416
We have found that these medications
can be rinsed in the mouth

21
00:01:13,416 --> 00:01:18,250
and spit out to give a local effect,
without causing any systemic side effects.

22
00:01:18,791 --> 00:01:21,958
If it's really hard for you to eat
because of the pain,

23
00:01:21,958 --> 00:01:26,208
we might give you a medicine
called lidocaine to numb the area.

24
00:01:26,416 --> 00:01:30,875
We would want you to rinse and swallow
this prior to each meal, which will give

25
00:01:30,875 --> 00:01:35,875
you a 15 to 20 minute window of numbness
to better eat and drink.
